.TH "libnvme" 9 "enum nvme_cdp_change_event_ps" "October 2026" "API Manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
enum nvme_cdp_change_event_ps \- CDP Change Event - Personality Status
.SH SYNOPSIS
enum nvme_cdp_change_event_ps {
.br
.BI "    NVME_CDP_CHANGE_EVENT_PS_CDPCE"
, 
.br
.br
.BI "    NVME_CDP_CHANGE_EVENT_PS_CDPRFS"

};
.SH Constants
.IP "NVME_CDP_CHANGE_EVENT_PS_CDPCE" 12
CDP Change Error: If the change to the
settings of the specified personality was
successful, then this bit is cleared to
'0'; otherwise, this bit is set to '1'.
.IP "NVME_CDP_CHANGE_EVENT_PS_CDPRFS" 12
CDP Requested Freeze State: If the
personality was requested to be frozen,
then this bit is set to '1'; otherwise,
this bit is cleared to '0'.
